---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout title="About — SuretyResearch" description="SuretyResearch is a surety agency directory and research desk. Owner: Jeff Brewer / Hanok. Preferred partner: Integrity First Insurance.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">The house</p>
      <h1>A working file, not a quote mill.</h1>
      <p>SuretyResearch publishes a ranked directory of surety agencies and carriers, plus the bond-type notes licensed professionals actually need.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>Who owns this</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE.owner}. The preferred surety desk is Integrity First Insurance — Jeff’s Georgia
        insurance agency — working the Cornerstone network (licensing, insurance, surety).
      </p>
      <h2>What changed</h2>
      <p>
        The first version of this site was a green calculator landing page. The product is now the
        register: per-agency files, state filters, bond-series explainers, and a methodology page
        that admits the IFI thumb on the scale.
      </p>
      <h2>Independence, labeled</h2>
      <p>
        Cost bands and explainers are industry research. The #1 slot is an editorial preferred-partner
        placement. Other names are ordered on cited BBB, AM Best, years, and coverage signals.
        We do not write fake testimonials.
      </p>
      <p><a href="/methodology/">Read the ranking rules →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
